# microWakeWord runtime volume — bind-mounted to /data in the training container.
# Everything here is generated or personal: synthetic samples, downloaded datasets,
# feature caches, checkpoints, and your own real_samples/ recordings. Never commit any
# of it (voice data + multi-GB downloads). This .gitignore is the only tracked file so
# the directory itself survives in the repo as a mount point.
*
!.gitignore
